The plate looks like a square side plate of about 22 cm. The bacon is a small pile of roughly 6-8 cooked strips, many of them broken, that spans about 9 cm.

Cooked bacon weighs about 8 g per slice, so 7 to 8 slices come to about 50-60 g. Cooked bacon has about 4.5 kcal/g, so that gives roughly 55 g × 4.5 ≈ 250 kcal. The pieces look thin and crispy, so I'll lower the estimate slightly to 40 g and 200 kcal.

